## Conditional Access – MFA for Privileged Accounts

### Policy Objective
Protect privileged accounts from credential-based attacks.

### Scope
-**Users:** GRP-Global-Admins
-**Cloud Apps:** All
-**Conditions:** Any location, any device
-**Access Control:** Require MFA

### Enforcement Logic
- MFA satisfied → Access granted
- MFA not satisfied → Access blocked

### Design Note
This tenant uses Microsoft Entra ID Free. Conditional Access enforcement
requires Entra ID P1. Policies are designed and documented for future enforcement.

